{"2591930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crystal Journey - Lum's Adventure", "steam_appid": 2591930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591930/extras/507e7b4d3741a82136b2129c6cf8df70.avif?t=1782834984\" width=600 height=103 /></span><br><br><strong>Crystal Journey - Lum's Adventure</strong> is a captivating 3D puzzle/adventure game where your goal is to guide Lum, a brave light spirit, through a world filled with challenging puzzles and stunning environments. Rotate the levels, think creatively, and solve intricate puzzles to reach the magical purple crystal that hold the key to Lum's journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><br>    <strong>Innovative Puzzle Mechanics</strong>: Rotate and manipulate the environment in unique ways to solve puzzles. Each level presents new challenges that require both logic and strategy to overcome.<br><br>    <strong>Four Distinct Chapters</strong>: Embark on a journey through 4 beautifully crafted chapters, each with 10 levels, more chapters will be available as we go on. Every chapter introduces its own unique visual style and puzzle elements, ensuring that no two levels are the same.<br><br>    <strong>Visually Stunning Environments</strong>: Explore a world where every chapter has a distinct look and feel, from mystical nature to ancient ruins, each rendered in a vibrant and enchanting art style.<br><br>    <strong>Immersive Audio Experience:</strong> Enjoy a captivating soundtrack and sound effects that enhance the gameplay and draw you deeper into Lum's world. The music sets the mood perfectly, whether you're deep in thought or celebrating a hard-earned victory.<br><br>    <strong>Challenging and Rewarding Gameplay</strong>: Test your puzzle-solving skills with a variety of intricate puzzles. The satisfaction of figuring out each level is matched only by the excitement of discovering what lies ahead.<br><br>Can you help<strong> Lum</strong> collect all the crystals and unlock the mysteries of this enchanted world? <strong>Crystal Journey - Lum's Adventure</strong> offers hours of engaging gameplay for puzzle enthusiasts and adventure lovers alike. Start your journey today!", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591930/extras/507e7b4d3741a82136b2129c6cf8df70.avif?t=1782834984\" width=600 height=103 /></span><br><br><strong>Crystal Journey - Lum's Adventure</strong> is a captivating 3D puzzle/adventure game where your goal is to guide Lum, a brave light spirit, through a world filled with challenging puzzles and stunning environments. Rotate the levels, think creatively, and solve intricate puzzles to reach the magical purple crystal that hold the key to Lum's journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><br>    <strong>Innovative Puzzle Mechanics</strong>: Rotate and manipulate the environment in unique ways to solve puzzles. Each level presents new challenges that require both logic and strategy to overcome.<br><br>    <strong>Four Distinct Chapters</strong>: Embark on a journey through 4 beautifully crafted chapters, each with 10 levels, more chapters will be available as we go on. Every chapter introduces its own unique visual style and puzzle elements, ensuring that no two levels are the same.<br><br>    <strong>Visually Stunning Environments</strong>: Explore a world where every chapter has a distinct look and feel, from mystical nature to ancient ruins, each rendered in a vibrant and enchanting art style.<br><br>    <strong>Immersive Audio Experience:</strong> Enjoy a captivating soundtrack and sound effects that enhance the gameplay and draw you deeper into Lum's world. The music sets the mood perfectly, whether you're deep in thought or celebrating a hard-earned victory.<br><br>    <strong>Challenging and Rewarding Gameplay</strong>: Test your puzzle-solving skills with a variety of intricate puzzles. The satisfaction of figuring out each level is matched only by the excitement of discovering what lies ahead.<br><br>Can you help<strong> Lum</strong> collect all the crystals and unlock the mysteries of this enchanted world? <strong>Crystal Journey - Lum's Adventure</strong> offers hours of engaging gameplay for puzzle enthusiasts and adventure lovers alike. Start your journey today!", "short_description": "Join Lum on his adventure to take the Magic Crystal by solving puzzles.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591930/5cc73771aeefd24af550df0609dabea308f5d288/header.jpg?t=1782834984", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591930/8c1159859bd67e4e2ac7a0f7d51f02409e5063fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782834984", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591930/8c1159859bd67e4e2ac7a0f7d51f02409e5063fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782834984", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X 10.11 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {